# Dart compiled-binary outputs (dart build cli)
**/build/cli/

# Libraries should not commit pubspec.lock per https://dart.dev/tools/pub/dependencies#lockfiles
**/pubspec.lock

# Local dev overrides — devs add these per-checkout for cross-package work.
**/pubspec_overrides.yaml

# Superpowers brainstorming working files (visual companion mockups, etc.)
.superpowers/

# Claude WIP design specs / implementation plans. This is their canonical
# home (see CLAUDE.md), but they are local working docs — kept in the
# worktree for later analysis, not committed.
docs/superpowers/

# Resolved upstream by Anspar-Org/elspais#97 (CUR-1329); kept locally only.
docs/elspais-refines-coverage-propagation-repro.md

# elspais MCP runtime cache and daemon state. The persistent config lives
# in .elspais.toml (tracked); only the runtime directory is ignored.
.elspais/
